  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://trello.com/1/cards/6175a9ee6f432a83e1ef6499/attachments/6175d949f30bd52ea88337b8/previews/6175d94af30bd52ea883385b/download/Daves_Potioneering_2.png\" alt=\"Promotional Banner\" width=\"2543\" height=\"662\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/903714979734229083/999144183619145778/spacer_2_2x.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1250\" height=\"25\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>📖 關於&nbsp;📖</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Dave&rsquo;s Potioneering</strong> 是一款對藥水與煉金術機制進行改動的模組，旨在讓 <strong>藥水的釀造與使用</strong> 變得更加有趣。我們並非僅僅向遊戲中添加更多藥水，而是透過調整釀造系統與物品欄管理，使藥水製作更為高效、應用方式更為直觀。&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400\">本模組全面優化了 Minecraft 現有的藥水與釀造機制，是極佳的 Vanilla+ 基礎模組，能完美搭配您正在使用的其他藥水相關模組。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400\">《Dave's Potioneering》需要安裝 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib</a></span>。</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">藥水現在可堆疊</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">噴濺型藥水投擲距離大幅增加</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">釀造效率提升</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">武器塗層</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">牛奶瓶</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">全新藥水武器</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">支援其他模組的藥水</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/odXNUudkpRY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>📘 維基／文件 📘</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">《Potioneering》是一款會在 Minecraft 世界中實作多項改動的模組，您可能在遊玩過程中體驗到這些變化。如果您想查詢精確數值、功能細節，或是想追蹤該模組的開發與管理進度，可以前往 <span style=\"color:#f00\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftrello.com%252fb%252fop7lAq4D%252fdaves-potioneering-roadmap\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 Trello 看板</a></span> 查看完整資訊。雖然它不像維基百科那樣花俏，但應該涵蓋了您所需的所有資料！若您有任何問題，或想提供反饋與建議，也歡迎隨時在 Discord 上聯繫我。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">版本資訊</span></strong></span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>1.16 Forge/Fabric, 1.18 Forge/Fabric, 1.19 Forge/Fabric, 1.20 Forge/Fabric</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0cf\"><a style=\"color:#0cf\" href=\"https://discord.gg/UAREMMjABE\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span> 社群已開放加入！歡迎進入回報錯誤、提供反饋，或是分享您的創作！</span></span></p>\n<p><br><br><br></p>",
